@BaseUrl = http://localhost:5200/api

### Device Endpoints
@deviceId = EP0702
@userId = 7

### Create Device
POST {{BaseUrl}}/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "DeviceId": "A1B2C3",
    "OwnerId": {{userId}},
    "CategoryId": 1
}

### 1. Get all devices of a person
GET {{BaseUrl}}/persons/{{userId}}/devices

### 2. Get a device
GET {{BaseUrl}}/devices/{{deviceId}}
